SELECT 'accra-agent-fees-renoviction-renters-defense', 'Accra Agent Fees & Renoviction: The Renter''s Defense Guide', '<p class="tldr"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Accra renting stacks 10% agent fees on illegal multi-year advances, plus viewing fees and renoviction risk. Defense: compare all-in two-year costs across listings, verify REAC registration, demand agreements, and budget the periphery''s transport tax honestly.</p><h2>What are the true costs beyond rent?</h2><p>Agent commission (~10% of the total advance - on a 2-year GHS 24,000 advance that''s GHS 2,400), viewing/inspection fees per property, legal/agreement fees, moving costs, and the hidden one: <strong>renoviction</strong> - forced moves outward where ''cheaper'' rent trades for poor roads, weak transport, fewer schools and clinics.</p><h2>How do you compare listings honestly?</h2><p>Compute <strong>all-in 24-month cost</strong>: (monthly × 24) + agent fee + moving + transport delta. A central GHS 1,200 room often beats a peripheral GHS 800 room once trotro hours and Bolt fares compound. ''You save on rent and pay with time, safety and dignity'' - price dignity in.</p><h2>How do you vet agents?</h2><p>REAC registration under Act 1047, written fee disclosure before viewings, no upfront ''registration fees'' to see properties, receipts for everything. Unregistered ''agents'' operating without accountability are a documented fraud vector.</p><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul><li>Compare 24-month all-in costs, never headline monthly rent.</li><li>Registered agents + receipts or walk away.</li><li>Periphery savings are partly a transport loan you repay daily.</li></ul><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><p><strong>Are viewing fees legal?</strong><br>Grey - but any fee before service with no receipt is a scam marker. Refuse.</p><p><strong>Can I negotiate the 10%?</strong><br>Yes, especially multi-property or repeat business. Everything in Accra renting is negotiable except the statute.</p><p><strong>Should diasporans use relocation experts?</strong><br>For first landings, yes - a fixed-fee expert beats percentage agents skimming advances.</p><p><em>Sources: The Africa Report 2026; REAC Act 1047.</em></p><p><em>House-hunting from abroad? <a href=''/workspace.html''>Sporafind</a> connects you with diaspora homeowners and vetted agents who quote legal advances - not obroni prices.</em></p>', '10% agent fees, viewing fees, and renoviction pushing families outward. How Accra renters compare true costs and hold their ground.', ARRAY['rent','agents','Accra','housing'], 'Relocation Guides', 'published', '2026-10-13T08:00:00.000Z', 'Accra Agent Fees & Renoviction Defense', 'Viewing fees, 10% commissions, renoviction: the renter''s defense guide to Accra''s true housing costs and how to hold ground.'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM blog_posts WHERE slug = 'accra-agent-fees-renoviction-renters-defense');
