SELECT 'off-plan-property-ghana-due-diligence-checklist', 'Off-Plan Property in Ghana: The Due-Diligence Checklist', '<p class="tldr"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Off-plan buys time (pay across construction, sometimes interest-free) but concentrates developer risk. Diligence: developer''s delivered record, project title + permits, escrowed payments, delay/penalty clauses, management plan. Never buy renders alone.</p><h2>Why do diasporans love off-plan?</h2><p>Lower entry (20-30% deposit), 12-24+ month spreads, below-completion pricing, grace periods. For savers building toward full price while construction advances, the structure fits diaspora cash flow perfectly.</p><h2>What is the 12-point checklist?</h2><p>1. Developer delivered history (visit past projects, interview owners). 2. Project land title + search. 3. Building permits lodged. 4. Escrow or milestone payments - never full upfront. 5. Delay penalties + completion dates in contract. 6. Specification schedule (finishes, brands). 7. Snagging/defects period. 8. Management company + sinking-fund terms. 9. Assignment/resale rights. 10. Rental-management option. 11. Ground-rent/service-charge caps. 12. Dispute forum + governing law.</p><h2>What are the walk-away signs?</h2><p>No delivered project, no permits, full-payment demands, no escrow, vague specs, pressure deadlines. Any two = exit.</p><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul><li>Buy the developer''s history, not the render.</li><li>Time-to-pay is valuable; tie every tranche to progress.</li><li>Sinking-fund terms decide your year-5 costs.</li></ul><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><p><strong>Are off-plan discounts real?</strong><br>Yes - typically below completion value - but discount is compensation for risk. Price it.</p><p><strong>What if the developer stalls?</strong><br>Penalty clauses + escrowed funds + step-in rights are your levers; without them you''re an unsecured creditor.</p><p><strong>Can I resell before completion?</strong><br>Only if assignment rights are contracted - confirm before signing.</p><p><em>Sources: Ghana Ground Up financing guide; developer market practice 2025-26.</em></p><p><em>House-hunting from abroad? <a href=''/workspace.html''>Sporafind</a> connects you with diaspora homeowners and vetted agents who quote legal advances - not obroni prices.</em></p>', 'Longer payment windows, developer risk. The 12-point off-plan checklist: title, permits, escrow, delivery history and contract clauses.', ARRAY['off-plan','developer','due diligence','investment'], 'Investment', 'published', '2026-10-13T08:00:00.000Z', 'Off-Plan Property in Ghana: Checklist', 'Off-plan means time to pay - and developer risk. The 12-point checklist covering title, permits, escrow, history and protective clauses.'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM blog_posts WHERE slug = 'off-plan-property-ghana-due-diligence-checklist');
