SELECT 'ecg-prepaid-meter-draining-fast-rights-fixes', 'ECG Prepaid Meter Draining Fast? Causes, PURC Rights & Fixes', '<p class="tldr"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> If credit drains far faster than history with unchanged usage, suspect faulty metering: log consumption, compare periods, engage ECG for investigation (minister-ordered probes set precedent), escalate to PURC for independent investigation - documented overbilling has won refunds.</p><h2>Why would credit drain faster?</h2><p>Candidates: <strong>faulty/fast meters</strong> (the 2026 complaint wave), <strong>tariff increases</strong> (~16% water, higher electricity tranches), <strong>new loads</strong> (heaters, pumps, AC in hot season), <strong>wiring faults/earth leakage</strong>, and <strong>neighbour tapping</strong>. Isolate methodically: audit loads first, then challenge metering.</p><h2>What is the complaint path?</h2><p>1. Log one week of meter readings + appliance inventory. 2. ECG complaint with records; demand meter testing. 3. Escalate to <strong>PURC</strong> (independent investigation mandate) if unresolved. 4. Consumer Protection Agency alongside. Timelines: ECG internal days-to-weeks; PURC steps in where utilities stall. Keep every receipt and reference number.</p><h2>Can you get refunds?</h2><p>Yes - where overbilling is established, regulators have ordered ECG refunds repeatedly. Prepaid recovery mechanics differ from postpaid holds, but precedent exists. Documentation decides.</p><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul><li>Data first: readings beat outrage.</li><li>ECG then PURC - in that order, with paper.</li><li>Refunds are real but only for the documented.</li></ul><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><p><strong>Can I withhold payment during disputes?</strong><br>Postpaid can strategically hold; prepaid can''t ''not buy'' - pursue testing + refund instead.</p><p><strong>Should I get an independent electrician?</strong><br>Yes - rule out internal leakage/tapping before the meter fight; electricians find what complaints can''t.</p><p><strong>Are smart meters coming?</strong><br>Rollouts continue amid availability struggles - request meter verification at every swap.</p><p><em>Sources: JoyNews PM Express/PURC 2026; News Night ECG coverage.</em></p><p><em>Costing your move? <a href=''/workspace.html''>Sporafind</a> connects you with returnees living your target lifestyle - real budgets, real streets, before you commit.</em></p>', 'GHS 100 lasting 3 days instead of a week: faulty meters, tariff effects and load growth - plus the PURC complaint path and refund precedents.', ARRAY['ECG','prepaid meter','electricity','PURC'], 'Relocation Guides', 'published', '2026-10-21T08:00:00.000Z', 'ECG Prepaid Draining Fast? Rights & Fixes', 'Credit vanishing 3x fast? Faulty meters, tariff math and the PURC complaint-to-refund path every consumer should know.'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM blog_posts WHERE slug = 'ecg-prepaid-meter-draining-fast-rights-fixes');
