SELECT 'accra-transport-costs-trotro-bolt-owning-car', 'Accra Transport Costs: Trotro vs Bolt vs Owning a Car', '<p class="tldr"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Trotros (<GHS 10/ride) win on cost; daily Bolt use compounds to ~$200/month; car ownership adds purchase/shipping (~$6,000 to ship), fuel (500-800/mo), maintenance and driver options (1,500/mo). Most returnees land hybrid: trotro + strategic Bolt, car later.</p><h2>What does each mode really cost?</h2><p><strong>Trotro/shared taxi:</strong> unbeatable per-ride, costs time and comfort. <strong>Bolt daily:</strong> convenient, ~GHS 200-500/month equivalent reported by carless couples - budget it like rent. <strong>Own car:</strong> buy/ship + fuel + servicing + insurance; driver transforms productivity at ~1,500/month.</p><h2>How does traffic change the math?</h2><p>Accra traffic is a time tax: central housing + trotro can beat peripheral housing + car on total cost once hours are priced. Hawker-economy logic applies - road time structures errands, shopping and social life. Location choice IS transport choice.</p><h2>What is the returnee sequence?</h2><p>Land with Bolt + trotro fluency first; add car when routes stabilise and income justifies; add driver when your hourly value exceeds 1,500/month. Selling abroad before shipping (vs $6K shipping) funds months of Bolts.</p><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul><li>Transport is housing''s shadow budget - decide together.</li><li>Daily Bolt is a car payment without the car.</li><li>Traffic hours are money; price them.</li></ul><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><p><strong>Should I ship my car?</strong><br>At ~$6,000 shipping plus duties math, selling abroad and buying locally often wins - run both numbers.</p><p><strong>Are ride-hailing prices stable?</strong><br>Fuel-linked and surge-prone; budget 20% buffer over current fares.</p><p><strong>Is driving myself advisable?</strong><br>Yes with defensive habits and local orientation period - hire a driver initially to learn routes.</p><p><em>Sources: Returnee budget accounts; Webnation cost interviews.</em></p><p><em>Costing your move? <a href=''/workspace.html''>Sporafind</a> connects you with returnees living your target lifestyle - real budgets, real streets, before you commit.</em></p>', 'Sub-GHS 10 trotro rides vs GHS 200/month Bolt habits vs full car ownership. The real transport math by lifestyle - plus traffic''s time tax.', ARRAY['transport','trotro','Bolt','car','Accra'], 'Market Intelligence', 'published', '2026-10-21T08:00:00.000Z', 'Accra Transport: Trotro vs Bolt vs Car', 'Trotro pennies vs Bolt hundreds vs car ownership: real monthly transport math by lifestyle, plus traffic''s hidden time tax.'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM blog_posts WHERE slug = 'accra-transport-costs-trotro-bolt-owning-car');
