SELECT 'chronic-medication-ghana-availability-planning', 'Chronic Medication in Ghana: Availability Planning Before You Move', '<p class="tldr"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Before relocating: confirm your exact molecules (not brands) are stocked in Accra pharmacies, carry 3-6 months surplus with prescriptions, arrange a shipment/refill pathway, and brief your Ghana doctor with full records on arrival.</p><h2>How do you confirm availability?</h2><p>Send your molecule list (generic names + dosages) to 2-3 major Accra pharmacies and your future hospital''s pharmacy for written confirmation. Brands differ; molecules matter. Note cold-chain items and controlled substances - both face extra friction.</p><h2>What do you carry and arrange?</h2><p><strong>Carry:</strong> 3-6 months supply, original packaging, prescriptions, doctor''s letter (airline + customs smooth). <strong>Arrange:</strong> home-country refill + courier pathway, local specialist for ongoing scripts, and insurance covering the drug tier. Never assume continuity - prove it.</p><h2>What about costs?</h2><p>Some meds cost more or come intermittently; private insurance formularies vary. Price your regimen at Accra retail before budgeting - surprises here break fixed incomes.</p><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul><li>Molecules, not brands, decide continuity.</li><li>Surplus + pathway beats hope every time.</li><li>Brief the new doctor with records, not memory.</li></ul><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><p><strong>Can pharmacies order for me?</strong><br>Major ones can source on lead time - establish the relationship before need.</p><p><strong>What about refrigerated meds?</strong><br>Dumsor makes cold-chain home storage risky - confirm pharmacy-held stock + backup power plan.</p><p><strong>Mental-health meds?</strong><br>Availability varies most here - verify first, carry most, line up a psychiatrist early.</p><p><em>Sources: Diaspora Affairs GH healthcare guides; returnee accounts.</em></p><p><em>Moving with family? <a href=''/workspace.html''>Sporafind</a> finds diaspora parents at your shortlisted schools and doctors returnees actually use - real experience before you commit.</em></p>', 'Your exact brand may not exist here. How to confirm stock, build surplus, arrange shipments, and brief your new doctor - before landing.', ARRAY['medication','healthcare','chronic','planning'], 'Relocation Guides', 'published', '2026-10-25T08:00:00.000Z', 'Chronic Medication in Ghana: Planning', 'Confirm stock, carry surplus, plan shipments: the chronic-medication checklist to complete before your flight to Ghana.'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM blog_posts WHERE slug = 'chronic-medication-ghana-availability-planning');
